  "title": "Zesty Nutty Croatian Sauerkraut Stew",
  "description": "A hearty and comforting Croatian stew featuring sauerkraut and nuts, perfect for a cozy dinner. This dish is FODMAP-friendly and made with dry-brined ingredients.",
