  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the sliced almonds and cook until lightly toasted, about 2 minutes.",
    "Add the chicken breast and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the sliced carrots and celery and cook until they start to soften, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the sauerkraut, paprika, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Pour in the chicken broth and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20 minutes.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional sliced almonds if desired.",
    "Cook poultry to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F before serving."
